	(descr "Molex Mini50 34792 series, 4 circuits, 2.00mm pitch, single row male vertical THT unsealed automotive header, 500V, 4.0A, -40 to +105C, tin over nickel, USCAR-2, flush mount to PCB. Contact holes 1.00mm on a 2.00mm pitch; 2x 2.15mm press-fit post holes at 11.70mm spacing, 2.55mm to -Y of the contact row (drop-in variant uses 2.55mm). Moulded body 14.62 x 9.94mm. Origin at the centre of the contact row. SD-34792-001 covers several 4-circuit polarisation variants sharing this land pattern, e.g. 34792-00401; confirm the order number and which end is circuit 1 before wiring")
